  "description": "Cross-reader session event id vectors. A tool use event id is <runId>.<callId> when that id matches the contract pattern ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{0,127}$ with 16 characters to spare for suffixes and the call id is neither empty nor root; otherwise <runId>.h<the first 32 hex digits of SHA-256 of the call id>. Run ids hold no dot, so the first dot ends the run part. The runner derives these ids (backend/services/runner/src/harness/events/ids.ts); a reader that answers a tool use derives the same id from the call id it holds. A file-review event id is derived from its change set id <runId>:<turnSeq> (the run is the text before the first colon): stigmer.file_review.changes is <runId>.fr<turnSeq> and stigmer.file_review.reconciled is <runId>.fr<turnSeq>.r, one per change set whichever run writes it.",
